WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.630
In 1579 two empires,
Ottoman and Safavid,

2
00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:09.617
were at war
across the Armenian highlands.

3
00:00:09.657 --> 00:00:12.087
Their armies crossed
the plain of Shirak,

4
00:00:12.127 --> 00:00:15.152
beneath Mount Aragats,
again and again.

5
00:00:15.392 --> 00:00:20.002
From 1604 Shah Abbas deported
whole Armenian communities,

6
00:00:20.042 --> 00:00:23.530
and Shirak was among
the lands emptied.

7
00:00:23.770 --> 00:00:29.284
Hold the winter road for the villagers
in the path of both empires.

